  "duration_s": 510.965517,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上级说道，一个小学毕业当过工人和赤脚医生的女人三十岁那年在一台缝纫机上开始写小说。您肯定想问，就他能写出个啥？可偏偏就是这台缝纫机上写出来的东西，后来震动了整个文坛，还让外国人排着队去研究它。今儿这段咱就讲讲一个裁缝是怎么从缝纫机台面上一路写进世界文学殿堂的。一九八三年，残雪三十岁，白天给人量体裁衣得了空，把布往边上一推，铺开纸就写别的作家要书房，要安静，要烟要酒。他只要一台缝纫机，他自己都觉得奇怪，坐下就能写，不用想情节，不用列提纲，一口气往下走，写出来的第一步叫黄泥街。他哥哥邓小蒙是武汉大学出了名的哲学教授，也是有大学问的人。看完他写的稿子，半天没说出话来，最后憋出一句，我从没见过这样的写法里头的劲儿，摧枯拉朽，可也带着股让人后怕的危险性。他劝残雪这东西，十年之内别想发表，弄不好要惹大祸，搁那个年月，这不是吓唬人，是真有人因为作品出过大事，黄泥街写完往哪儿发，有人推荐到北京的大杂志退回来了，托人送到上海，人家也不要兜兜转转好几年稿子都翻旧了。最后是老作家丁玲拍了板，把他登在自己主编的刊物上，那已经是一九八六年了。书一出来，长沙的文坛先炸了锅，这人谁呀？一个裁缝写的东西跟谁都不一样。残血就这样从一个踩缝纫机的个体户，一步跨成了先锋文学的代表人物，怎么形容他写的东西呢？有人说了句特到位的话，残血像个女巫，文字在他手里服服帖帖，可拼出来的画面，诡异规律，像一场醒不过来的梦。你说他写的是小说吧，字里行间全是诗的质地，哲学的骨头。这种东西不是技巧能磨出来的，是他前半辈子那些苦，那些荒诞从骨头缝里咽出来。正因为这份独一份的味道，残血在西方文学圈彻底杀疯了。他是作品被翻译的最多的中国作家之一，美国、哈佛、康奈尔、哥伦比亚这些顶尖大学拿他的书当文学教材。日本人专门办了一本以他名字命名的研究杂志。你品品一个中国作家，让外国人专门出本杂志来研究，这是什么待遇？诺奖评委大名鼎鼎的汉学家马跃然直接给他扣了顶大帽子。中国的卡夫卡美国作家苏珊桑塔格说的更干脆，残血是中国最好的作家。二零一二年，莫言拿诺奖前，有人问他预测谁，他想了想说，我不预测，但我希望是中国的女作家残雪获奖。二零一五年，残血萍最后的情人拿下美国最佳翻译图书奖。至今为止，拿过这个奖的中国作家，就他一个。二零一九年，二零二一年，他又两次闯进国际不客奖的长名单，那是全世界文学圈最难进的名单之一。可问题来了，墙内开花墙外香，残雪在国外被追着捧，回到国内却跟隐形人似的。为什么？除了大家心照不宣的原因，更大的问题出在他这个人身上，太值了。他早年公开说过一句话，中国文坛好多作家都在混日子，那些所谓的批评家抱成一团，糊弄读者，这一句话，得罪了多少人？他还不光嘴上说，专门写了本书，但着文坛挨个点名，这也是残学。这些年，在公众视野里几度消失的原因之一，但有意思的是人可以被消音文字消不了。如今他七十多岁了，缩在原云南一个安静的角落里，写作的劲头比年轻人还猛，他的作息几十年如一日。刻板的象台中早上七点准时起，九点坐下读哲学，写哲学一个半小时，下午两点接着读，接着写又是一个半小时。白天这两段，他下的全是哲学的功夫，然后起身锻炼跑步，从年轻的时候就开始跑步，就直坚持到现在在长沙跑，在北京跑到云南接着跑，等晚饭落了桌，才轮到他一天。真正的正活写小说就写一个钟头，八九百百字，一笔一画全是手写，写完再坐下来学英语英文原版书，一页一页啃七十三岁，白天啃哲学，晚上手写小说，还学英语跑步，这几样摊到咱自己身上哪一样都不容易。有人说，他年年上诺奖赔率榜却年年落空替他惋惜，可他自己早把这事看淡了。他曾经这样形容自己的写作是我活的方式，写作是活的方式。他自己解读为不是谋生的手段，不是出名的梯子，是活着的本身。至于那个奖是锦上添花，花开不开花，都在那儿开着。听到这儿肯定有朋友，心里开始痒痒了。这么个奇人，他写的作品到底是个啥味儿？我也想翻番，可他那么多书，头一回读，从哪本下手问的好，我给您交个底。连给他出书的出版社都讲了一句话，读残雪就从黄泥阶开始，为啥偏偏是他？您别忘了，这就是他。三十岁那年在裁缝铺的缝纫机上，把布料往边上一推，铺开纸一个字一个字，熬出来的第一部长篇写了好几年，被人退了一回又一回，最后靠丁玲拍板才见着天日。他后来呢将近九十本书的根全在这一本里，他写一条脏的不能再脏的街，人在里头像虫子一样挣扎着活着，嘴上说着大道理，背地里喂了一口，吃的什么都肯干。他哥哥邓小蒙看完说，里头有股摧枯拉朽的生命力。您读这本书，读的不是一条街上的热闹，是一个人在最苦的年月里，怎么把心里那团不肯灭的火一笔一笔写成了字。我把这本黄泥街给您放在视频左下角链接里了，感兴趣的朋友可以拍回家，细细品读，最后动动手指转发给家里人发到咱相亲相爱一家人的群里，让更多人知道咱中国还有这样一位了不起的女作家，咱们下期继续讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1015,
      "text": "上级说道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4140,
      "end_ms": 15645,
      "text": "一个小学毕业当过工人和赤脚医生的女人三十岁那年在一台缝纫机上开始写小说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 18460,
      "end_ms": 19520,
      "text": "您肯定想问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 19880,
      "end_ms": 21920,
      "text": "就他能写出个啥？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 22160,
      "end_ms": 25560,
      "text": "可偏偏就是这台缝纫机上写出来的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 26300,
      "end_ms": 28440,
      "text": "后来震动了整个文坛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 29000,
      "end_ms": 31800,
      "text": "还让外国人排着队去研究它。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 33020,
      "end_ms": 42200,
      "text": "今儿这段咱就讲讲一个裁缝是怎么从缝纫机台面上一路写进世界文学殿堂的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 43240,
      "end_ms": 44240,
      "text": "一九八三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 44760,
      "end_ms": 46100,
      "text": "残雪三十岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 46180,
      "end_ms": 48870,
      "text": "白天给人量体裁衣得了空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 49090,
      "end_ms": 50670,
      "text": "把布往边上一推，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 51210,
      "end_ms": 54130,
      "text": "铺开纸就写别的作家要书房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 54330,
      "end_ms": 55010,
      "text": "要安静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 55270,
      "end_ms": 56209,
      "text": "要烟要酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 56530,
      "end_ms": 57990,
      "text": "他只要一台缝纫机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 58650,
      "end_ms": 60175,
      "text": "他自己都觉得奇怪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 60600,
      "end_ms": 61600,
      "text": "坐下就能写，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 61720,
      "end_ms": 62875,
      "text": "不用想情节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 63130,
      "end_ms": 64125,
      "text": "不用列提纲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 64530,
      "end_ms": 65825,
      "text": "一口气往下走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 66130,
      "end_ms": 69205,
      "text": "写出来的第一步叫黄泥街。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 70090,
      "end_ms": 74255,
      "text": "他哥哥邓小蒙是武汉大学出了名的哲学教授，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 74720,
      "end_ms": 76205,
      "text": "也是有大学问的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 76720,
      "end_ms": 77880,
      "text": "看完他写的稿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 77980,
      "end_ms": 79305,
      "text": "半天没说出话来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 79730,
      "end_ms": 80810,
      "text": "最后憋出一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 80890,
      "end_ms": 84575,
      "text": "我从没见过这样的写法里头的劲儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 85240,
      "end_ms": 86180,
      "text": "摧枯拉朽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 86560,
      "end_ms": 88904,
      "text": "可也带着股让人后怕的危险性。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 89810,
      "end_ms": 91775,
      "text": "他劝残雪这东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 92070,
      "end_ms": 93575,
      "text": "十年之内别想发表，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 94120,
      "end_ms": 95725,
      "text": "弄不好要惹大祸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 96220,
      "end_ms": 97080,
      "text": "搁那个年月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 97260,
      "end_ms": 98295,
      "text": "这不是吓唬人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 98600,
      "end_ms": 100975,
      "text": "是真有人因为作品出过大事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 101460,
      "end_ms": 103415,
      "text": "黄泥街写完往哪儿发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 103790,
      "end_ms": 107055,
      "text": "有人推荐到北京的大杂志退回来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 107290,
      "end_ms": 108490,
      "text": "托人送到上海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 108730,
      "end_ms": 112670,
      "text": "人家也不要兜兜转转好几年稿子都翻旧了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 112710,
      "end_ms": 115229,
      "text": "最后是老作家丁玲拍了板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 115370,
      "end_ms": 117695,
      "text": "把他登在自己主编的刊物上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 118380,
      "end_ms": 120055,
      "text": "那已经是一九八六年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 120540,
      "end_ms": 121360,
      "text": "书一出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 121600,
      "end_ms": 123595,
      "text": "长沙的文坛先炸了锅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 124220,
      "end_ms": 125045,
      "text": "这人谁呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 125480,
      "end_ms": 128115,
      "text": "一个裁缝写的东西跟谁都不一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 129000,
      "end_ms": 132715,
      "text": "残血就这样从一个踩缝纫机的个体户，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 133210,
      "end_ms": 136165,
      "text": "一步跨成了先锋文学的代表人物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 137150,
      "end_ms": 138865,
      "text": "怎么形容他写的东西呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 139360,
      "end_ms": 141425,
      "text": "有人说了句特到位的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 141810,
      "end_ms": 143105,
      "text": "残血像个女巫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 143580,
      "end_ms": 145505,
      "text": "文字在他手里服服帖帖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 145850,
      "end_ms": 147030,
      "text": "可拼出来的画面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 147070,
      "end_ms": 148790,
      "text": "诡异规律，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 149110,
      "end_ms": 150955,
      "text": "像一场醒不过来的梦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 151770,
      "end_ms": 153475,
      "text": "你说他写的是小说吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 154120,
      "end_ms": 156435,
      "text": "字里行间全是诗的质地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 156880,
      "end_ms": 157915,
      "text": "哲学的骨头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 158340,
      "end_ms": 161505,
      "text": "这种东西不是技巧能磨出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 162080,
      "end_ms": 163940,
      "text": "是他前半辈子那些苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 164240,
      "end_ms": 167365,
      "text": "那些荒诞从骨头缝里咽出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 168010,
      "end_ms": 170250,
      "text": "正因为这份独一份的味道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 170710,
      "end_ms": 173995,
      "text": "残血在西方文学圈彻底杀疯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 174470,
      "end_ms": 177605,
      "text": "他是作品被翻译的最多的中国作家之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 178320,
      "end_ms": 184515,
      "text": "美国、哈佛、康奈尔、哥伦比亚这些顶尖大学拿他的书当文学教材。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 184920,
      "end_ms": 190255,
      "text": "日本人专门办了一本以他名字命名的研究杂志。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 190900,
      "end_ms": 193435,
      "text": "你品品一个中国作家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 193760,
      "end_ms": 197035,
      "text": "让外国人专门出本杂志来研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 197660,
      "end_ms": 198695,
      "text": "这是什么待遇？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 199210,
      "end_ms": 204985,
      "text": "诺奖评委大名鼎鼎的汉学家马跃然直接给他扣了顶大帽子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 205790,
      "end_ms": 210815,
      "text": "中国的卡夫卡美国作家苏珊桑塔格说的更干脆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 211270,
      "end_ms": 213855,
      "text": "残血是中国最好的作家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 214830,
      "end_ms": 215750,
      "text": "二零一二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 215750,
      "end_ms": 217185,
      "text": "莫言拿诺奖前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 218120,
      "end_ms": 219425,
      "text": "有人问他预测谁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 220260,
      "end_ms": 221180,
      "text": "他想了想说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 221300,
      "end_ms": 222005,
      "text": "我不预测，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 222400,
      "end_ms": 225475,
      "text": "但我希望是中国的女作家残雪获奖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 225900,
      "end_ms": 226845,
      "text": "二零一五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 227240,
      "end_ms": 231525,
      "text": "残血萍最后的情人拿下美国最佳翻译图书奖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 231960,
      "end_ms": 232885,
      "text": "至今为止，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 233250,
      "end_ms": 234885,
      "text": "拿过这个奖的中国作家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 235320,
      "end_ms": 236385,
      "text": "就他一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 238060,
      "end_ms": 239395,
      "text": "二零一九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 240280,
      "end_ms": 241500,
      "text": "二零二一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 242240,
      "end_ms": 245820,
      "text": "他又两次闯进国际不客奖的长名单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 246340,
      "end_ms": 250260,
      "text": "那是全世界文学圈最难进的名单之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 251700,
      "end_ms": 252660,
      "text": "可问题来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 252980,
      "end_ms": 254760,
      "text": "墙内开花墙外香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 255400,
      "end_ms": 257300,
      "text": "残雪在国外被追着捧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 257640,
      "end_ms": 260620,
      "text": "回到国内却跟隐形人似的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 260640,
      "end_ms": 261280,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 261420,
      "end_ms": 263500,
      "text": "除了大家心照不宣的原因，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 263960,
      "end_ms": 266740,
      "text": "更大的问题出在他这个人身上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 267000,
      "end_ms": 267940,
      "text": "太值了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 268600,
      "end_ms": 270430,
      "text": "他早年公开说过一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 270870,
      "end_ms": 273890,
      "text": "中国文坛好多作家都在混日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 274270,
      "end_ms": 277190,
      "text": "那些所谓的批评家抱成一团，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 277290,
      "end_ms": 278209,
      "text": "糊弄读者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 278350,
      "end_ms": 279030,
      "text": "这一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 279230,
      "end_ms": 280290,
      "text": "得罪了多少人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 280530,
      "end_ms": 281910,
      "text": "他还不光嘴上说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 282250,
      "end_ms": 283590,
      "text": "专门写了本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 284390,
      "end_ms": 286350,
      "text": "但着文坛挨个点名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 286890,
      "end_ms": 288430,
      "text": "这也是残学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 288450,
      "end_ms": 288910,
      "text": "这些年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 288910,
      "end_ms": 292390,
      "text": "在公众视野里几度消失的原因之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 293030,
      "end_ms": 297290,
      "text": "但有意思的是人可以被消音文字消不了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 297570,
      "end_ms": 299270,
      "text": "如今他七十多岁了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 299490,
      "end_ms": 301915,
      "text": "缩在原云南一个安静的角落里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 302360,
      "end_ms": 304445,
      "text": "写作的劲头比年轻人还猛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 305210,
      "end_ms": 307925,
      "text": "他的作息几十年如一日。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 308350,
      "end_ms": 312070,
      "text": "刻板的象台中早上七点准时起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 312430,
      "end_ms": 315070,
      "text": "九点坐下读哲学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 315530,
      "end_ms": 318290,
      "text": "写哲学一个半小时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 319110,
      "end_ms": 321390,
      "text": "下午两点接着读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 322610,
      "end_ms": 327110,
      "text": "接着写又是一个半小时。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00119",
      "start_ms": 327950,
      "end_ms": 329090,
      "text": "白天这两段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00120",
      "start_ms": 330890,
      "end_ms": 332990,
      "text": "他下的全是哲学的功夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00121",
      "start_ms": 333130,
      "end_ms": 336150,
      "text": "然后起身锻炼跑步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00122",
      "start_ms": 336930,
      "end_ms": 338610,
      "text": "从年轻的时候就开始跑步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00123",
      "start_ms": 339390,
      "end_ms": 342730,
      "text": "就直坚持到现在在长沙跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00124",
      "start_ms": 343570,
      "end_ms": 346690,
      "text": "在北京跑到云南接着跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00125",
      "start_ms": 347770,
      "end_ms": 348950,
      "text": "等晚饭落了桌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00126",
      "start_ms": 349430,
      "end_ms": 350930,
      "text": "才轮到他一天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00127",
      "start_ms": 351030,
      "end_ms": 354830,
      "text": "真正的正活写小说就写一个钟头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00128",
      "start_ms": 355130,
      "end_ms": 356100,
      "text": "八九百百字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00129",
      "start_ms": 356480,
      "end_ms": 358660,
      "text": "一笔一画全是手写，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00130",
      "start_ms": 359000,
      "end_ms": 363900,
      "text": "写完再坐下来学英语英文原版书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00131",
      "start_ms": 364380,
      "end_ms": 367160,
      "text": "一页一页啃七十三岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00132",
      "start_ms": 367240,
      "end_ms": 368365,
      "text": "白天啃哲学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00133",
      "start_ms": 368900,
      "end_ms": 370220,
      "text": "晚上手写小说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00134",
      "start_ms": 370520,
      "end_ms": 372215,
      "text": "还学英语跑步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00135",
      "start_ms": 372950,
      "end_ms": 376605,
      "text": "这几样摊到咱自己身上哪一样都不容易。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00136",
      "start_ms": 377300,
      "end_ms": 377900,
      "text": "有人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00137",
      "start_ms": 377900,
      "end_ms": 383065,
      "text": "他年年上诺奖赔率榜却年年落空替他惋惜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00138",
      "start_ms": 383680,
      "end_ms": 385645,
      "text": "可他自己早把这事看淡了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00139",
      "start_ms": 386220,
      "end_ms": 390765,
      "text": "他曾经这样形容自己的写作是我活的方式，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00140",
      "start_ms": 391410,
      "end_ms": 392625,
      "text": "写作是活的方式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00141",
      "start_ms": 393000,
      "end_ms": 396355,
      "text": "他自己解读为不是谋生的手段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00142",
      "start_ms": 396760,
      "end_ms": 398160,
      "text": "不是出名的梯子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00143",
      "start_ms": 398300,
      "end_ms": 399735,
      "text": "是活着的本身。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00144",
      "start_ms": 400510,
      "end_ms": 403685,
      "text": "至于那个奖是锦上添花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00145",
      "start_ms": 404360,
      "end_ms": 405780,
      "text": "花开不开花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00146",
      "start_ms": 405860,
      "end_ms": 406875,
      "text": "都在那儿开着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00147",
      "start_ms": 407510,
      "end_ms": 409270,
      "text": "听到这儿肯定有朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00148",
      "start_ms": 409270,
      "end_ms": 410585,
      "text": "心里开始痒痒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00149",
      "start_ms": 411670,
      "end_ms": 412805,
      "text": "这么个奇人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00150",
      "start_ms": 413170,
      "end_ms": 415375,
      "text": "他写的作品到底是个啥味儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00151",
      "start_ms": 416020,
      "end_ms": 417125,
      "text": "我也想翻番，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00152",
      "start_ms": 417600,
      "end_ms": 418705,
      "text": "可他那么多书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00153",
      "start_ms": 419080,
      "end_ms": 419865,
      "text": "头一回读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00154",
      "start_ms": 420200,
      "end_ms": 422325,
      "text": "从哪本下手问的好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00155",
      "start_ms": 422660,
      "end_ms": 423685,
      "text": "我给您交个底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00156",
      "start_ms": 424740,
      "end_ms": 427175,
      "text": "连给他出书的出版社都讲了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00157",
      "start_ms": 427960,
      "end_ms": 431160,
      "text": "读残雪就从黄泥阶开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00158",
      "start_ms": 432080,
      "end_ms": 433560,
      "text": "为啥偏偏是他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00159",
      "start_ms": 434520,
      "end_ms": 435420,
      "text": "您别忘了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00160",
      "start_ms": 436260,
      "end_ms": 437040,
      "text": "这就是他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00161",
      "start_ms": 437040,
      "end_ms": 440380,
      "text": "三十岁那年在裁缝铺的缝纫机上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00162",
      "start_ms": 440620,
      "end_ms": 442420,
      "text": "把布料往边上一推，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00163",
      "start_ms": 442560,
      "end_ms": 444320,
      "text": "铺开纸一个字一个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00164",
      "start_ms": 444320,
      "end_ms": 447200,
      "text": "熬出来的第一部长篇写了好几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00165",
      "start_ms": 447360,
      "end_ms": 449060,
      "text": "被人退了一回又一回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00166",
      "start_ms": 449360,
      "end_ms": 452820,
      "text": "最后靠丁玲拍板才见着天日。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00167",
      "start_ms": 453480,
      "end_ms": 457040,
      "text": "他后来呢将近九十本书的根全在这一本里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00168",
      "start_ms": 457040,
      "end_ms": 459910,
      "text": "他写一条脏的不能再脏的街，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00169",
      "start_ms": 460430,
      "end_ms": 463630,
      "text": "人在里头像虫子一样挣扎着活着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00170",
      "start_ms": 464030,
      "end_ms": 465430,
      "text": "嘴上说着大道理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00171",
      "start_ms": 465730,
      "end_ms": 466870,
      "text": "背地里喂了一口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00172",
      "start_ms": 466870,
      "end_ms": 468710,
      "text": "吃的什么都肯干。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00173",
      "start_ms": 469090,
      "end_ms": 471010,
      "text": "他哥哥邓小蒙看完说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00174",
      "start_ms": 471010,
      "end_ms": 473130,
      "text": "里头有股摧枯拉朽的生命力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00175",
      "start_ms": 474690,
      "end_ms": 475650,
      "text": "您读这本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00176",
      "start_ms": 475710,
      "end_ms": 477750,
      "text": "读的不是一条街上的热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00177",
      "start_ms": 477970,
      "end_ms": 480250,
      "text": "是一个人在最苦的年月里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00178",
      "start_ms": 480570,
      "end_ms": 485110,
      "text": "怎么把心里那团不肯灭的火一笔一笔写成了字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00179",
      "start_ms": 486190,
      "end_ms": 490080,
      "text": "我把这本黄泥街给您放在视频左下角链接里了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00180",
      "start_ms": 490440,
      "end_ms": 492300,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友可以拍回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00181",
      "start_ms": 492300,
      "end_ms": 493245,
      "text": "细细品读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00182",
      "start_ms": 494080,
      "end_ms": 501625,
      "text": "最后动动手指转发给家里人发到咱相亲相爱一家人的群里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00183",
      "start_ms": 502660,
      "end_ms": 508690,
      "text": "让更多人知道咱中国还有这样一位了不起的女作家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2dd2488b04507c8f_s00184",
      "start_ms": 508990,
      "end_ms": 510825,
      "text": "咱们下期继续讲。"
    }
  ],
